    "text": "Her onginne\u00f0 secgan be \u00feam Godes sanctum, \u00fee on Engla lande \u00e6rost reston.\nSanctus Albanus, martir on Breotone, se reste\u00f0 neah W\u00e6tlingaceastre be \u00feare ea, \u00fee is genemnod\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 Columcylle on \u00feare stowe, \u00fee is genemnod Duncachan, neah \u00feare ea \u00fee is genemnod\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus Cuthberhtus on \u00feare stowe, \u00fee men hata\u00f0 Dunholm.\n\u00d0onne is sancte Oswoldes heafod cyninges mid sancte Cuthberhtus lichaman, and his swi\u00f0re earm is\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus Iohannes biscop on \u00feare stowe Beferlic, neah \u00feare ea Hul.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Ecgbriht and sancte Wilfer\u00f0 biscop and sancte Wihtburh on \u00feam mynstre, \u00fee is\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Ceadda and sancte Cedde and sancte Ceatta on \u00feam mynstre, \u00fee is genemnod\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Higebold on Lindesige on \u00feare stowe, \u00fee is genemnod Cecesege, neah \u00feare ea, \u00fee\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte \u00c6\u00feered, se cyningc, and sancte Ostry\u00f0, sancte Oswoldes swustor cynges, on \u00feam\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Eadburh Su\u00f0willum neah \u00feare ea Treonte.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Gu\u00f0lac on \u00feare stowe, \u00fee is genemnod Cruland, \u00fe\u00e6t mynster is on middan\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Ealhmund on Nor\u00f0wor\u00feig, neah \u00feare ea Deorwentan.\n\u00d0onne w\u00e6s sancte Botulf bebirged on \u00feam mynstre, \u00fee is genemnod Medeshamstede, \u00fe\u00e6t is neah\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte \u00c6\u00feelbriht \u00e6t \u00feam biscopstole \u00e6t Hereforda, neah \u00feare ea W\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Cett on \u00feam mynstre, \u00fee is genemnod Undola, neah \u00feare ea Nen.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Mildburh on \u00feam mynstre Wenlocan neah \u00feare ea, \u00fee mon S\u00e6fern hate\u00f0.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Wigstan on \u00feam mynstre Hreopedune neah \u00feare ea Treonte.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Dioma on \u00feare stowe, \u00fee is genemnod Ceorlingcburh, neah \u00feare ea Wenrisc.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Eadgi\u00f0 on \u00f0are stowe, \u00fee is gehaten Polleswyr\u00f0, neah \u00feare ea Oncer.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Rumwold on \u00feare stowe, \u00fee is gehaten Buccyngaham, neah \u00feare ea Usan.\n\u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte \u00c6\u00f0elbyrht on \u00feam mynstre, \u00fee man hate\u00f0 Bydanford neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Usan.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte \u00c6\u00feelred \u00e6t Leomynstre, neah \u00feare ea Lucge.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Eadmund cyningc \u00e6t Beadriceswyr\u00f0e on Eastenglum.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Osgi\u00f0 on Cicc, neah \u00feare s\u00e6 on sancte Petres mynstre.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancta \u00c6\u00feelburh on \u00feam mynstre \u00e6t Beorcyngan neah T\u00e6mese.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Erconwald se biscop on Lundenbirig.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Neot, m\u00e6ssepreost on Eanulfesbirig.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 \u00e6t Ramesige sancte Iua and sancte \u00c6\u00feelred and sancte \u00c6\u00feelbriht.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 on Burh sanctus Florentius martir and sancte Cynesweo\u00f0 and sancte Cyneburh and\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 on \u00feornige sancte Botulf and sancte A\u00f0ulf and sancte Huna and sancte \u00feancred and\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 on Abbandune sanctus Uincentius martir.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus Dunstanus arcebiscop and sanctus Agustinus \u00e6t Cantwarabirig and fela o\u00f0ra\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus Paulinus on Rofeceastre.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus Birinus, se Romanisca biscop, on Winceastre on Ealdan mynstre and sanct\u00e6\n\u00d0onne resta\u00f0 on Niwan mynstre sanctus Iudocus and sanctus Grimbaldus.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancta Eadburh on nunnan mynstre.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 on Rumesige sancta M\u00e6rwyn, w\u00e6s seo forme abbodesse \u00fe\u00e6s mynstres, and sancte\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Iwi biscop and sancte Eadgi\u00f0 on Wiltune.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Eadweard cyningc and sancta \u00c6lfgiuu on Sceaftesbirig.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus Aidanus and sanctus Patricius on Gl\u00e6stingabirig and fela o\u00f0ra sancta.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus Congarus confessor on Cungresbirig.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Sidefulle f\u00e6mne wi\u00f0utan Exanceastre.\n\u00d0onne sanctus Romanus biscop on T\u00e6uistoce.\n\u00d0onne sanctus Petrocus on Westwealum be \u00feare s\u00e6, neah \u00feam fleote, \u00fee man clypa\u00f0 H\u00e6gl\u00e6mu\u00f0a.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus M\u00e6ildun and sanctus Aldelmus and Iohannes se wisa on Ealdelmesbirig.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus Oswaldus arcebiscop on Wigeraceastre and fela o\u00f0re haligra biscopa mid him.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus Ecgwinus biscop on Eouesham, neah \u00feare ea Auene.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Kenelm cynebearn on Wincelescumbe.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Cu\u00f0burh and Cwenburh on Winburnan mynstre, \u00fee \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6t minicena lif and\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Fry\u00f0esweo\u00f0 on Oxenaforda.\n\u00deonne is on Middeltune sancte Brangwalatoris heafod, biscopes, and sancte Samsones earm,\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Cu\u00f0man \u00e6t St\u00e6ningum on Su\u00f0seaxum, neah \u00feare ea Br\u00e6mbre.\n\u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Beocca abbod and Edor m\u00e6ssepreost on Cyrtesige \u00feam mynstre, and \u00fear man\nSi lof and wuldor h\u00e6lendum Criste his godnessa in ealra worulda world on ecnysse, amen.",
